Version 4
SHEET 1 1280 880
TEXT 72 48 Left 3 ;TP2 Simulation 1 - non-inverting switched-capacitor integrator
TEXT 72 96 Left 2 ;This working schematic uses SPICE directives directly to avoid LTspice Mac switch-symbol pin issues.
TEXT 72 136 Left 2 ;Run, then plot V(VE), V(VS), V(PHI1), and V(PHI2).
TEXT 72 176 Left 2 ;Expected result: with k=C1/C2=1 and Ve=1V, VS rises by about 1V per clock period until saturation.
TEXT 72 240 Left 2 !.param CVAL=10p
TEXT 72 280 Left 2 !Vphi1 PHI1 0 PULSE(0 5 0 10u 10u 480u 1m)
TEXT 72 320 Left 2 !Vphi2 PHI2 0 PULSE(0 5 500u 10u 10u 480u 1m)
TEXT 72 360 Left 2 !Ve VE 0 1
TEXT 72 400 Left 2 !Vcc VCC 0 5
TEXT 72 440 Left 2 !Vee VEE 0 -5
TEXT 72 500 Left 2 !S1 VE A PHI1 0 SWID
TEXT 72 540 Left 2 !S2 A 0 PHI2 0 SWID
TEXT 72 580 Left 2 !C1 A B {CVAL}
TEXT 72 620 Left 2 !S3 B 0 PHI1 0 SWID
TEXT 72 660 Left 2 !S4 B SUM PHI2 0 SWID
TEXT 72 700 Left 2 !C2 SUM VS {CVAL} IC=0
TEXT 640 240 Left 2 ;Leakage resistors and tiny parasitic capacitors only prevent floating-node numerical errors.
TEXT 640 280 Left 2 !RA A 0 1T
TEXT 640 320 Left 2 !RB B 0 1T
TEXT 640 360 Left 2 !RSUM SUM 0 1T
TEXT 640 400 Left 2 !CA A 0 1f
TEXT 640 440 Left 2 !CB B 0 1f
TEXT 640 480 Left 2 !CSUM SUM 0 1f
TEXT 640 540 Left 2 ;Smooth ideal op-amp: non-inverting input at 0V, inverting input at SUM, output softly limited to +/-4.95V.
TEXT 640 600 Left 2 !BOP VS 0 V=4.95*tanh(-1e5*V(SUM))
TEXT 640 660 Left 2 !.model SWID SW(Ron=10 Roff=1g Vt=2.5 Vh=0.2)
TEXT 640 700 Left 2 !.ic V(VS)=0 V(SUM)=0 V(A)=0 V(B)=0
TEXT 640 740 Left 2 !.options method=gear reltol=0.003
TEXT 640 780 Left 2 !.tran 0 10m 0 2u uic
